*> Report Writer: names in SOURCE, SUM, TYPE CONTROL, CONTROL, and
*> RESET ON are read when the report is produced.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SALESRPT.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SALES-FILE ASSIGN TO "SALES"
        FILE STATUS IS SALES-STATUS.
    SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO "PRINT".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  SALES-FILE.
01  SALES-REC.
    05  SR-REGION       PIC X(4).
    05  SR-AMOUNT       PIC 9(7)V99.
FD  PRINT-FILE
    REPORT IS SALES-REPORT.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  SALES-STATUS        PIC XX.
01  END-OF-SALES        PIC X VALUE "N".
REPORT SECTION.
RD  SALES-REPORT
    CONTROLS ARE FINAL SR-REGION
    PAGE LIMIT IS 60 LINES
    HEADING 1
    FIRST DETAIL 5
    LAST DETAIL 55.
01  TYPE IS PAGE HEADING.
    05  LINE NUMBER IS 1.
        10  COLUMN 1    PIC X(20) VALUE "SALES BY REGION".
        10  COLUMN 70   PIC Z9 SOURCE IS PAGE-COUNTER.
01  SALES-LINE TYPE IS DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
    05  COLUMN 1        PIC X(4) SOURCE SR-REGION GROUP INDICATE.
    05  COLUMN 10       PIC Z(6)9.99 SOURCE IS SR-AMOUNT.
01  TYPE CONTROL FOOTING SR-REGION NEXT GROUP PLUS 2.
    05  LINE PLUS 1.
        10  COLUMN 1    PIC X(10) VALUE "TOTAL".
        10  REGION-TOTAL COLUMN 10 PIC Z(7)9.99
                        SUM SR-AMOUNT UPON SALES-LINE.
01  TYPE CONTROL FOOTING FINAL LINE NEXT PAGE.
    05  COLUMN 1        PIC X(10) VALUE "GRAND".
    05  COLUMN 10       PIC Z(8)9.99 SUM REGION-TOTAL RESET ON FINAL.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    OPEN INPUT SALES-FILE OUTPUT PRINT-FILE
    IF SALES-STATUS NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "CANNOT OPEN SALES: " SALES-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF
    INITIATE SALES-REPORT
    PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-SALES = "Y"
        READ SALES-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO END-OF-SALES
            NOT AT END GENERATE SALES-LINE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    TERMINATE SALES-REPORT
    CLOSE SALES-FILE PRINT-FILE
    STOP RUN.
